The pending group-transition state can make the viewer report that no next technology is available while it is still showing HeatCore and loading CyberMind.

Review comment:

- [P2] Keep the next-group action tied to the displayed group — /Users/asmirnou/Projects/g/ramsider/components/TechnologyViewer.tsx:149-153
  If a user clicks Next Technology twice while the CyberMind image is still decoding, the first click sets `requested.current.group` to CyberMind but the viewer still displays HeatCore. The second click takes this branch and announces that the next technology is unavailable, even though CyberMind has not appeared yet. Ignore repeated group navigation while that transition is pending, or base the unavailable state on the displayed group. This leaves a visible control giving a false result during a normal slow-image interaction, contrary to the usable-controls requirement in [AGENTS.md:20](AGENTS.md#L20).
